      "open_question": "at exactly 0 W the grid is idle \u2014 in no flow group \u2014 so every per-source map is empty and the sensors reading them publish nothing. A connected meter reading zero is arguably not the same as an absent one; whether these per-source sensors should show 0 (grid present, delivering nothing) rather than go blank is unsettled."
